SUMMARY:You Can See Everything
LOCATION:Kendall Square\, 355 Binney St\, Cambridge\, MA 02142
DESCRIPTION:Times: 12:25pm\, 1:25pm\, 4pm\, 5pm\, 7:35pm\, 8:35pm\nThirty-f
 our days before she’s sent to prison\, notorious Silicon Valley founder 
 Elizabeth Holmes invites a skeptical film crew to document her every move.
  What begins as an intimate portrait of an enigmatic felon becomes a mind-
 bending three-year journey into the abyss. From boundary-pushing directors
  Nathan Fielder and Lance Oppenheim comes YOU CAN SEE EVERYTHING.\nhttps:/
 /booking.landmarktheatres.com/launch/ticketing/3226d4c4-8f56-50b0-a87e-c03
 937503223\nFrom Pushpin Boston: https://pushpin.city/boston/
