SUMMARY:Wicker
LOCATION:Kendall Square\, 355 Binney St\, Cambridge\, MA 02142
DESCRIPTION:Times: 12:55pm\, 3:30pm\, 7:15pm\, 9:45pm\nAn audacious comedic
  fable about sex\, marriage\, and the absurdities of social convention\, W
 ICKER tells the wholly original love story of an ostracized fisherwoman (O
 livia Colman) who commissions a husband to be made by the local basketmake
 r (Peter Dinklage). When her wicker husband (Alexander Skarsgård) proves 
 more spectacular than she ever imagined\, his soulful spirit and unique pr
 owess awaken something inside her\, setting off a wave of jealousy\, fasci
 nation\, and upheaval that threatens the very fabric of village life.\nhtt
 ps://booking.landmarktheatres.com/launch/ticketing/1e32d091-e5b9-5497-9ba1
 -2426a1d41a95\nFrom Pushpin Boston: https://pushpin.city/boston/
URL:https://booking.landmarktheatres.com/launch/ticketing/1e32d091-e5b9-549
 7-9ba1-2426a1d41a95
END:VEVENT
