 s into a secret\, dangerously alive world. A girl’s desperate quest to s
 ave her baby brother unfolds into a spectacular\, high-stakes adventure th
 rough a forbidden forest full of enchanted creatures\, endearing allies\, 
 and formidable adversaries—where an entire hidden realm hangs in the bal
 ance. In an era of automation\, LAIKA delivers its most ambitious and glob
 ally accessible film yet—a bold fusion of human-crafted artistry and cin
 ematic storytelling from the makers of Coraline.\nhttps://www.westnewtonci
 nema.com/movie/wildwood\nFrom Pushpin Boston: https://pushpin.city/boston/
