SUMMARY:Fjord
LOCATION:Kendall Square\, 355 Binney St\, Cambridge\, MA 02142
DESCRIPTION:Times: 3:20pm\, 6:45pm\nFrom two time Palm d'Or winner Cristian
  Mungiu\, a Norwegian woman and her devout Romanian husband relocate with 
 their five children to a remote\, close-knit\, coastal town. Their teenage
  children form a fast bond with a neighboring family as unease begins to s
 immer around their rigid beliefs. When allegations of abuse emerge\, they 
 are forced to confront a system of judgement that blurs the lines between 
 concern and prejudice.\nhttps://booking.landmarktheatres.com/launch/ticket
 ing/3691970f-2f5a-5ac5-8fdc-6e09ac0d59cf\nFrom Pushpin Boston: https://pus
 hpin.city/boston/
