SUMMARY:Wicker
LOCATION:Kendall Square\, 355 Binney St\, Cambridge\, MA 02142
DESCRIPTION:Times: 4:20pm\, 7:10pm\nAn audacious comedic fable about sex\, 
 marriage\, and the absurdities of social convention\, WICKER tells the who
 lly original love story of an ostracized fisherwoman (Olivia Colman) who c
 ommissions a husband to be made by the local basketmaker (Peter Dinklage).
  When her wicker husband (Alexander Skarsgård) proves more spectacular th
 an she ever imagined\, his soulful spirit and unique prowess awaken someth
 ing inside her\, setting off a wave of jealousy\, fascination\, and upheav
 al that threatens the very fabric of village life.\nhttps://booking.landma
